bodies = PackedStringArray("SAMPLE: Pick an egg, place the item it hatches, then race to the flag. First to 10 points wins.", "SAMPLE: Reach the flag. Tapos 1.0, Una +0.25, Bayani +0.5, Patibong +0.25 per kill, Bawi +0.75.", "SAMPLE: Touch to pass the taya. When the timer ends the taya is out. Last chicken standing wins.", "SAMPLE: Match the slipper pose: KANG, GA, ROO. Three misses and you are out.", "Live entries from the item definitions.", "SAMPLE: Shake can be Full, Reduced or Off. Every cue also has a shape, text or motion, never colour alone.")
